	(gr_text "Impedance controlled layers: Top, L3, L5, L8, L10, Bottom:\n\n100 Ohm differential:\n- Top/Bottom: 0.115 mm width / 0.1 mm gap\n- Inner (L3/L5/L8/10): 0.1mm width/ 0.16mm gap\n\n50 Ohm single-ended:\n- Top/Bottom: 0.2mm width\n- Inner: 0.11mm width\n\nNOTE! The IS400 substrate and exact stackup is not obligatory. Permitted changes are:\n- Any FR4 with simimilar Er/Dk and loss factor <= 0.02.\n- Stackup thickness can be adjusted to meet the impedance requirements if the material is to be changed.\nPermitted final board thickness between 1.5 and 2.0 mm.\n\n"
